{"id":"cecotec-salmon-a-la-toscana-en-ollas-gm","sourceUrl":"https://cecotec.es/recetas/ollas-gm/salmon-a-la-toscana-en-ollas-gm","publishedAt":"2025-01-24T13:16:45+01:00","name":{"es":"Salmón a la toscana","en":"Tuscan-style salmon"},"description":{"es":"","en":""},"appliances":["olla-gm"],"course":"main","tags":["olla-gm","main"],"baseServings":2,"servingsMax":null,"servingsUnit":"comensales","servingsText":"2","minutes":15,"minutesSource":"cecotec","timeBucket":"le15","difficulty":"medium","difficultySource":"cecotec","kcalPerServing":null,"photoUrl":"https://ecom-media-manager-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/image/2a64d242-4659-4a66-91b5-123868c06ab8.jpg","cookedCount":0,"ingredients":[{"ingredientId":"diente-de-ajo","quantity":2,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"2 dientes de ajo"},{"ingredientId":"aceite-de-oliva","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Aceite de oliva"},{"ingredientId":"sal","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Sal"},{"ingredientId":"cebolla","quantity":75,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"75 g de cebolla"},{"ingredientId":"pimenton","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Pimentón"},{"ingredientId":"albahaca","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Albahaca"},{"ingredientId":"lomo-de-salmon","quantity":2,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"2 lomos de salmón"},{"ingredientId":"tomate-cherry","quantity":100,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"100 g de tomates Cherry"},{"ingredientId":"leche-evaporada","quantity":200,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"200 g de leche evaporada"},{"ingredientId":"queso-parmesano-rallado","quantity":35,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"35 g de parmesano rallado"},{"ingredientId":"pimienta","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Pimenta"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Echamos un chorrito de aceite de oliva en la cubeta, programamos el menú plancha durante 8 minutos, cuando alcance la temperatura añadimos el salmón y doramos por ambos lados. Reservar.","en":"Pour a drizzle of olive oil into the pot, select the \"Plancha\" menu for 8 minutes, once it reaches temperature add the salmon and brown on both sides. Set aside."},"timerMinutes":8},{"text":{"es":"A continuación, añadimos la cebolla y el ajo picado y los cherrys partidos por la mitad, salpimentamos.","en":"Next, add the onion and chopped garlic and the halved cherry tomatoes, season with salt and pepper."}},{"text":{"es":"Pasados 4 minutos, agregamos la leche evaporada, el parmesano, una pizca de pimentón y unas hojas de albahaca.","en":"After 4 minutes, add the evaporated milk, the parmesan, a pinch of paprika and a few basil leaves."},"timerMinutes":4},{"text":{"es":"Incorporamos el salmón y dejamos reposar en la salsa unos minutos.","en":"Add the salmon and leave to rest in the sauce for a few minutes."}}]}